846	    // passes everything: the scenario silently ran `CancelMidGeneration` and
847	    // never exercised the case it exists for, a driver wrongly flushing a
848	    // *buffered* stop reason on cancel. The usage chunk is the fixture's own
849	    // marker for "the stop reason has gone past", so requiring it discriminates
