469	                // delta under the blank id. Replacing then would split one call
470	                // across two `call_id`s: the name would have gone out under
471	                // `""` and every later delta under the real id, leaving the
472	                // real id with zero name-carrying deltas. That is an "exactly
473	                // once" violation on a *non-blank* `call_id` — worse than the
